    <main id = "main-content" role="main">
        <div class = "container">
            <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
                <h2 id = "about-heading">Past Projects</h2>
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="about-text">
                        <p>This page is for learning about my past projects to get a feel of what I'm comfortable with.</p>
                        
                    </div>

                    <aside class="interests" aria-labelledby="interests-heading">
                        <h3 id = "interests-heading" style="font-style: italic;">"Every Champion was once a contender who refused to give up" -Rocky BalboaS</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Basic Calculator</summary>
                                    <p>Built for Intro to Computer Science. This was one of the first real projects I completed; although not that impressive, I still consider it as a milestone in my career</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Zombie Generator</summary>
                                    <p>Built for Object Oriented Programming. This project was fun and one of the first projects I had a lot of fun making. I challenged me at the time and also demonstrated a lot of good OOP principles</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>Zomba Game</summary>
                                    <p>Built as a Final for Object Oriented Programming. This was taking the zombie generator further and turning it into a RTS game. This was a very fun project and I still take a little pride in it.</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <details>
                                    <summary>File Roulette</summary>
                                    <p>Built for Project Managment. This was a C# program that had a slot machine that took files from your computer as payment. If you lost it would encrpyt the files and store them in local memory until you 'won' them back. First real team project, it was awesome!</p>
                                </details>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                            
                    </aside>
